{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-223625-r4630367","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Nilagang Baka (Boiled Beef and Vegetables in Broth)","sourcePageId":223625,"sourceRevision":"4630367","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-04-12T21:37:43Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Nilagang%20Baka%20(Boiled%20Beef%20and%20Vegetables%20in%20Broth)&oldid=4630367","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:32.266Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Filipino recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using beef rib","Category:Recipes using cabbage","Category:Recipes using chive","Category:Recipes using corn","Category:Recipes with images","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"da4712dfc943090c5cf961a23e56ece4574c6a9fff698892ac39b97b0b65d695","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Meat recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n| Image = [[File:NilagangBaka.jpg|300px]]\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the Philippines|Cuisine of the Philippines]]\n\n'''Nilagang baka''' is a Philippine dish of boiled beef and vegetables in broth.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 2½ [[Cookbook:Kilogram|kg]] [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]] ribs\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] black [[Cookbook:Peppercorn|peppercorns]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], quartered\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Potato|potato]], quartered\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]], quartered\n* 2 pieces of Chinese [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Corn|corn]] cob, quarter-sliced\n* ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 2 onion [[Cookbook:Chive|chives]]\n* 2 pieces of ''saba''\n\n==Procedure==\n# Boil beef, peppercorns, onion, salt, corn, and potato until tender.\n# [[Cookbook:Slicing|Slice]] onion chives into 3-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] strips. Add to the boiling beef.\n# Slice saba into half. Add to the boiling beef.\n# Serve in one large bowl or individual serving bowls.\n# Serve with [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]] on the side.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using beef rib]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Filipino recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chive]]\n[[Category:Recipes using corn]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cabbage]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Nilagang Baka (Boiled Beef and Vegetables in Broth)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2½ kg beef ribs","sourceText":"2½ kg beef ribs","amountText":"2½ kg beef ribs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ teaspoon black peppercorns","sourceText":"½ teaspoon black peppercorns","amountText":"½ teaspoon black peppercorns","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 onion, quartered","sourceText":"1 onion, quartered","amountText":"1 onion, quartered","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 potato, quartered","sourceText":"1 potato, quartered","amountText":"1 potato, quartered","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 cabbage, quartered","sourceText":"1 cabbage, quartered","amountText":"1 cabbage, quartered","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 pieces of Chinese cabbage","sourceText":"2 pieces of Chinese cabbage","amountText":"2 pieces of Chinese cabbage","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 corn cob, quarter-sliced","sourceText":"1 corn cob, quarter-sliced","amountText":"1 corn cob, quarter-sliced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"½ teaspoon salt","sourceText":"½ teaspoon salt","amountText":"½ teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"2 onion chives","sourceText":"2 onion chives","amountText":"2 onion chives","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-10","name":"2 pieces of saba","sourceText":"2 pieces of saba","amountText":"2 pieces of saba","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null}],"steps":[{"n":1,"text":"Boil beef, peppercorns, onion, salt, corn, and potato until tender.","sourceText":"Boil beef, peppercorns, onion, salt, corn, and potato until tender.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":2,"text":"Slice onion chives into 3-inch strips. Add to the boiling beef.","sourceText":"Slice onion chives into 3-inch strips. Add to the boiling beef.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":3,"text":"Slice saba into half. Add to the boiling beef.","sourceText":"Slice saba into half. Add to the boiling beef.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":4,"text":"Serve in one large bowl or individual serving bowls.","sourceText":"Serve in one large bowl or individual serving bowls.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":5,"text":"Serve with rice on the side.","sourceText":"Serve with rice on the side.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; pa